      "note": "The listing of every 5-set of two-ququint stabilizer states whose span contains |T5>^2, one per orbit of the unitary symmetry group, lives in the stored batch outputs under research/t5q_m2_rank5/results/ (74 batches, 155,422 pivot-partner units, every unit run, 0 undecided, one hit: the five Z(x)Z eigensectors, a set fixed by the group). The certificate re-enumerates the plan, re-runs the exact k = 1..4 censuses, verifies the hashes and geometry of every output, re-decides the stored hit, fails on any undecided unit, re-runs two batches from scratch, and then runs the exact lift decision of research/t5_m3_lift/lift.py on the listed set. The completeness of the listing rests on the stored outputs and on research/t5q_m2_rank5/batch.py, which regenerates any batch (batch.py K), under the modular assumption every kernel census of the project makes: a member whose image is nonzero over Q(zeta_5) is nonzero modulo 65521."
